WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.631
You and I share something in common.

2
00:00:01.631 --> 00:00:03.278
We're both very beautiful and very tall.

3
00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:04.111
Yeah.

4
00:00:04.111 --> 00:00:08.278
(audience cheering and applauding)

5
00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:11.076
We hit it off.

6
00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:13.065
I remember when we first met, we hit it off.

7
00:00:13.065 --> 00:00:13.986
It was just...

8
00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:16.729
I mean potentially related, hopefully married.

9
00:00:16.729 --> 00:00:20.562
(Conan and audience laughing)

10
00:00:21.471 --> 00:00:22.304
I have to make one phone call to get this done.

11
00:00:22.304 --> 00:00:23.137
Yeah, okay.

12
00:00:24.741 --> 00:00:26.039
I'm ready, I'm waiting.

13
00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:26.872
I am there.

14
00:00:26.872 --> 00:00:29.450
But what I've noticed is that there are so many,

15
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.791
women can sort of put a hat down and not be noticed,

16
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.870
but you're very striking, you're very tall.

17
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.181
You don't blend in.
Yeah, not me.

18
00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:38.120
I'm not blending anytime soon.

19
00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.461
I mean and I often think in kind of the most mundane

20
00:00:40.461 --> 00:00:43.371
situations, of course no one would ever recognize me.

21
00:00:43.371 --> 00:00:44.322
I went to the dentist.

22
00:00:44.322 --> 00:00:47.083
I was having a horrific root canal.

23
00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.179
The dentist, he went through it.

24
00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:50.022
I was traumatized, he left the room.

25
00:00:50.022 --> 00:00:51.295
The dental nurse was there.

26
00:00:51.295 --> 00:00:52.438
The clamp was in my mouth.

27
00:00:52.438 --> 00:00:53.768
She was peering in.

28
00:00:53.768 --> 00:00:55.569
And I was there sort of gripping,

29
00:00:55.569 --> 00:00:57.710
and I thought she was about to offer me some soothing words

30
00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:58.591
and instead I get,

31
00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.523
"Tell me what happens in Game of Thrones!"

32
00:01:00.523 --> 00:01:01.603
(laughing)

33
00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:04.301
While I'm there prostrating, tortured.

34
00:01:04.301 --> 00:01:06.799
So there's a lot of boons to this job.

35
00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:07.701
There's a lot of (snapping) plus points.

36
00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:08.926
[Conan] Right.

37
00:01:08.926 --> 00:01:10.556
Torture in dental chair.

38
00:01:10.556 --> 00:01:12.889
(laughing)

